Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.93,0:00:16.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seek freedom, and it will lie\Nstretched out before your eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Karaoke
Dialogue: 1,0:00:12.81,0:00:15.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}KaitouYahiko
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(44,109)\fscx110\fscy110\bord3.3}Soundtracking
Dialogue: 1,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.81,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Halee
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.17,0:00:19.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the endless dream guides\Nyour restless spirit,
