Dialogue: 1,0:00:17.81,0:00:20.31,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Gab
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.69,0:00:23.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,seize it, raise your flag and stand tall.
