Dialogue: 1,0:00:22.94,0:00:25.44,Credits-207-,,0,0,0,,{\pos(89,170)\fscx135\fscy135\bord3.5}Chloelyy\NGaijin\NPamkinPenguin\Nrangicus
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.01,0:00:32.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think back to the time\Nwhen my search first began.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.81,0:00:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I left behind those shores of sand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.43,0:00:38.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the endless everlasting\Nworld out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:42.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.91,0:00:48.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday, somewhere, I'll finally see the\Nlight I have searched for everywhere?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.13,0:00:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When the summer sun is shining.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.85,0:00:58.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shaking the sails of my heart. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.15,0:01:05.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A brand new world that has been hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.91,0:01:08.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has opened up its doors for me to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.01,0:01:11.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A way from the moon's sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.93,0:01:15.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wearing in the troubled waves.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.47,0:01:17.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From all despair I can be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.97,0:01:21.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For the horizon on the other side is.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.27,0:01:23.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.59,0:01:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is what I am for?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.67,0:01:28.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And though I travel far\Nfrom where my search began,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.79,0:01:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,over seas of green and shores of sand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.39,0:01:34.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,through the endless\Neverlasting world out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.43,0:01:38.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that with this\Nburning passion driving me,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.07,0:01:44.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someday somewhere I'll finally see the\Nlight. I will search for everywhere.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(725,0)\bord1.8\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(684,725,\1a&H00&)}The Knock-Up Stream
Dialogue: 2,0:01:49.78,0:01:54.78,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.8\fad(725,0)\c&HE7E5E6&\bord0\4a&HFF&}The Knock-Up Stream
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.87,0:01:57.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where the heck is that\Nrubbery, bug-eyed idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.55,0:01:58.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.29,0:02:01.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't we all agree to be\Nhere over 45 minutes ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.93,0:02:03.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna miss the current.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.47,0:02:08.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure the genius didn't even stop to\Nconsider how the gold would weigh him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:11.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why does he always insist on\Nmaking everything ten times harder?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.89,0:02:14.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only schedule Luffy's\Nconcerned with is his own.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.43,0:02:17.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's got a point there.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.11,0:02:19.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't think someone in\Ntown beat him up, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.65,0:02:21.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, you mean that guy Bellamy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.41,0:02:24.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, if Bellamy didn't beat him\Nup, you better believe I will!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.93,0:02:26.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, was that right, tough girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.43,0:02:31.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.21,0:02:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.57,0:02:39.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look there! He's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.21,0:02:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.17,0:02:42.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.69,0:02:45.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy, hurry, we're\Nalready behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.49,0:02:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, it's a Hercules!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It took me forever to find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.45,0:02:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're kidding me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.93,0:02:53.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you crazy?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.89,0:03:04.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, that's awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.35,0:03:07.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Introducing the Going\NMerry Flying Edition.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.07,0:03:09.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can fly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:10.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.56,0:03:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.48,0:03:13.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They built it just for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.15,0:03:18.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Morons.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.06,0:03:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something about it makes\Nme feel kinda uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.97,0:03:23.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, for once I agree with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.29,0:03:25.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chickens don't even know how to fly.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.23,0:03:26.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They should've made it a pigeon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:29.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that got to do\Nwith anything, you dope?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.77,0:03:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.55,0:03:33.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, if you're with\Nme, let me hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.51,0:03:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.13,0:03:41.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:46.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get on board, unless you plan on missing\Nyour chance at the sky, like a fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.73,0:03:49.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:53.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.11,0:03:55.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, thanks for the ship, you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can have my Hercules.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.57,0:04:03.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.37,0:04:04.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.45,0:04:05.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.75,0:04:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's so kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.45,0:04:09.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, enough of this foolishness!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.19,0:04:12.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have much time! Follow us!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.43,0:04:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll lead the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.41,0:04:16.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, Luffy, let's go! Coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.45,0:04:27.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This city of gold is just a fairy\Ntale that Noland dreamt it all up!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.53,0:04:31.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Saruyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.97,0:04:32.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.77,0:04:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you men.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.51,0:04:38.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care what happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You give our friends here\Neverything you've got.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.69,0:04:48.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Time to set sail!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.37,0:04:53.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, shove off! Alright!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.01,0:04:55.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.25,0:05:11.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, kid, looks like this\Nis where we part ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.83,0:05:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.39,0:05:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's only one thing you gotta\Nremember above everything else. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.27,0:05:25.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not one person in history has ever\Ndisproved the existence of Sky Island.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:27.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.87,0:05:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People may say I'm crazy and even\Nlaugh at me, but I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.49,0:05:37.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm a romantic like you romantic
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.19,0:05:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So long
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.31,0:05:48.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah thanks for the gold
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.83,0:05:52.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And hey don't be falling\Nfrom the sky you hear
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.51,0:05:59.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See you around pops thanks\Nfor everything cricket?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.43,0:06:03.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think of us when you find\Nthe City of Gold, old-timer!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.07,0:06:07.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try and take it easy, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.11,0:06:09.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mind your own business.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.13,0:06:19.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's morning already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.85,0:06:22.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Burgess, see anything out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.83,0:06:26.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't even see an\Noutline of the shore yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really think they're\Ngoing to that Sky Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.95,0:06:30.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.99,0:06:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so they say they'll be pretty\Ntough to follow up there,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.15,0:06:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we gotta take care of them before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, listen up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.71,0:06:40.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's currently 7 a.m.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.83,0:06:44.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to arrive at our final\Ndestination no later than 11.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.81,0:06:46.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like Cricket already told us.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.85,0:06:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The spot where the knock-up stream\Nerupts is different every single time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.75,0:06:56.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get there as early as possible\Nin order to pinpoint its exact location.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.05,0:06:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.09,0:07:02.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like we're already\Nrunning a little behind schedule.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.55,0:07:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, are you knuckleheads\Npaying attention?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.51,0:07:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:09.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It has to face forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:12.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen a bird quite like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.49,0:07:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He only faces south. Isn't that funny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.01,0:07:17.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The goofy bird acts just like a compass.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.11,0:07:22.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear what it said?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.67,0:07:24.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He said he's going to\Nface a different direction
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.77,0:07:27.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on purpose and laugh\Nat us once we're lost.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.79,0:07:29.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and try.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.53,0:07:34.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, he's really facing north.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.65,0:07:44.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Told ya he couldn't do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.43,0:07:50.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, show the boss some respect\Nand pipe down over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.51,0:07:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, they're fine. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.63,0:07:56.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It reminds me of the old days\Nwhen I was young and irreverent.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.91,0:07:57.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.27,0:07:59.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.89,0:08:00.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.80,0:08:03.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no point getting\Nso worked up, Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.95,0:08:05.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Try to relax!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.57,0:08:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And who put us behind schedule again?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.21,0:08:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:09.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.04,0:08:11.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Being tense won't get us anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.69,0:08:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may as well enjoy ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.59,0:08:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see your point.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.07,0:08:16.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.49,0:08:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anyone not relaxing answers to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.01,0:08:23.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's better.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.91,0:08:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.89,0:08:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boss, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.43,0:08:31.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.67,0:08:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see the Kimulo Regalis\NCloud to the southwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.29,0:08:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It can't be!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.20,0:08:37.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What time is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.12,0:08:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ten o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.13,0:08:39.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're a full hour early!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.63,0:08:42.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoujou, do you think we can make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.33,0:08:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dispatch the Udon divers!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.35,0:08:46.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Find me those currents!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:51.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.39,0:08:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on now?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.63,0:08:58.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The cumuloregalus clouds appeared\Na lot sooner than expected,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.61,0:09:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so now everyone's scrambling\Nto find a current!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.49,0:09:09.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sonar waves detected!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.97,0:09:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a large current at 12 o'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.15,0:09:14.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Large creature detected at 9 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.19,0:09:15.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be a sinking!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.03,0:09:20.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's wave activity detected at 10\No'clock going against the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.73,0:09:22.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I believe it's a giant whirlpool, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:23.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.93,0:09:26.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Full speed ahead directly for 10 o 'clock!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.19,0:09:29.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the knock-up stream's\Ngonna erupt, I'm sure of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.19,0:09:30.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.71,0:09:35.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.81,0:09:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The waves are getting higher!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.89,0:09:38.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna sink!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.35,0:09:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Steady, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.71,0:09:45.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a pre-eruption tremor! Eruption?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.93,0:09:47.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Navigator!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.51,0:09:49.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What has the log post said?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.99,0:09:57.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's pointing straight at those clouds.\NYou mean the sky islands above that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.97,0:10:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,wind direction's perfect the clouds are\Nlining up exactly over the center of the
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,whirlpool what whirlpool i haven't seen\Nanything nice work brother i think we
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.37,0:10:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hit the jackpot this time yes and it\Nseems we're in for a nice-sized explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.27,0:10:14.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think we'll make it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.93,0:10:15.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.81,0:10:18.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.03,0:10:21.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll lead you to the inner edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.55,0:10:23.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, but what should we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.77,0:10:26.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Position yourself on the floor\Nand head towards the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.99,0:10:28.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then you'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.15,0:10:31.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants us to go to the center?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.73,0:10:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't remember signing up\Nfor all this. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.45,0:10:41.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll make sure nothing happens to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.71,0:10:44.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen one quite this big before.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.15,0:10:48.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is bad! I changed my mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.05,0:10:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to go back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.19,0:10:52.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, Usopp. Too late for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.39,0:10:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know who is already excited.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.39,0:10:56.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go to the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.97,0:11:20.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's time for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.05,0:11:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest is up to you now. Good luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.99,0:11:27.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, guys, and thanks\Na lot for everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.71,0:11:29.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't go! Don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.27,0:11:30.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please take me with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.37,0:11:34.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give me a break, I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.43,0:11:35.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please don't make me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.21,0:11:40.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one said anything about diving\Nheadfirst It's into a giant whirlpool!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.33,0:11:42.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's getting dark! Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.37,0:11:43.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think so, did!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.41,0:11:46.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would be so unreasonable, Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.27,0:11:47.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go back while we still have time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.99,0:11:51.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you understand? The Skypiea\Nstuff is just a bunch of make-believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.19,0:11:53.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not worth getting us killed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.53,0:11:54.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all make-believe?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.09,0:11:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that what you think? Usopp's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.61,0:11:59.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this is a really bad idea!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.71,0:12:02.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be a stupid\Ndream, but I have to try!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It could be our greatest adventure!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.47,0:12:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.47,0:12:08.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it's too late!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.05,0:12:16.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instead of wasting your time bickering,\Nyou all might want to take a look.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.69,0:12:21.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's sucking us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.27,0:12:27.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, Nami! Let my arms look at you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.93,0:12:37.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.84,0:12:38.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.91,0:12:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.15,0:12:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.31,0:12:44.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.65,0:12:51.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.87,0:12:53.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's starting.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.31,0:12:58.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The whirlpool sunk under the surface.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.05,0:13:02.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.39,0:13:05.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold it right there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.19,0:13:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro! Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.43,0:13:11.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.99,0:13:20.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, well, well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.89,0:13:23.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it isn't straw and loopy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.97,0:13:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.05,0:13:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's that Mocktown guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.09,0:13:28.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.49,0:13:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've come all this way to\Ncollect your 100 million bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.07,0:13:34.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So don't be shy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.11,0:13:41.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Were those youngsters\Nexpecting some company?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.93,0:13:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know, brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.13,0:13:48.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.04,0:13:50.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why is it getting dark out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.07,0:13:51.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,100 million?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.37,0:13:53.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.03,0:13:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb with me, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.97,0:13:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It says right here, Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.07,0:14:00.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Luffy won it for 100 million.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.19,0:14:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for Pirate Hunter\NZoro, 60 million Barry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.83,0:14:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:09.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's got a different\Nposter for each of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.39,0:14:12.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Zoro, congratulations\Non your new bounty.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.41,0:14:13.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Usa.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.99,0:14:14.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.05,0:14:16.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.19,0:14:18.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.10,0:14:18.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.85,0:14:20.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.89,0:14:26.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like your bounties must have\Ngone way up after the Alabasta incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.85,0:14:28.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But a hundred million?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.93,0:14:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is great! Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.23,0:14:33.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My bounty went up big time!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.11,0:14:36.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ha, ha, 60 million's not too bad either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.73,0:14:38.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not a good thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.55,0:14:42.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure to keep your eyes\Nopen going, Merry Crew!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.81,0:14:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.72,0:14:50.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope they're ready for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.45,0:14:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Brace yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.75,0:14:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone hold on or get inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.61,0:15:03.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh no! The ship!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.65,0:15:05.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's being lifted up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.89,0:15:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.99,0:15:46.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to capsize!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.65,0:15:51.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold steady!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.83,0:15:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't let go, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.87,0:15:58.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go, Sky Island!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.45,0:16:06.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's happening? We're\Nsailing up a huge pillar
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.19,0:16:10.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of water this is awesome\Nhow are we doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.83,0:16:19.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wind oh right i can't believe it's\Nfinally happening let's go to Skypea!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.33,0:16:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on it's not going\Nto be that easy look oh
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.25,0:16:29.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what now what's wrong did\Nwe forget about something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.73,0:16:31.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The hole's starting to float.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.65,0:16:35.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't stop it, we're\Ngoing to fall into the ocean.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.49,0:16:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you expect us to do about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.09,0:16:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're having a hard enough\Ntime holding on as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.59,0:16:41.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What haven't you noticed?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.47,0:16:43.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no! What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.15,0:16:45.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Sea King.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.53,0:16:47.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is that the one from before?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.73,0:16:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.64,0:16:55.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before\Nthe same thing happens to the Mary.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.85,0:16:57.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, but what can we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.93,0:17:01.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a whole lot of options\Nwhen it comes to Mother Nature.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.21,0:17:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're at her mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.49,0:17:04.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we hold on and hope for the best
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.49,0:17:22.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Spread the sails right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.03,0:17:26.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, it's a pillar of water,\Nbut it's still part of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.11,0:17:27.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a rising current.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.99,0:17:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The wind from below is a rising air\Ncurrent produced by geothermal heat,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.07,0:17:33.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,causing a steam explosion.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.69,0:17:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It may be packaged differently,\Nbut it's still wind and water.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.03,0:17:39.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Trust me, I'm a navigator, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.13,0:17:42.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.51,0:17:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, gang, Nami's leading the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.59,0:17:51.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, guys, catch the starboard\Nwind and align the ship with the current!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.67,0:17:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma 'am!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.57,0:17:57.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, we're ranging above\Nthe water, is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.39,0:17:59.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, do something!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.23,0:18:00.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're gonna fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.83,0:18:02.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.99,0:18:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.27,0:18:11.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.41,0:18:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're headed to the sky!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:15.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We made it there in place.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.81,0:18:19.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did it! Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:21.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nami, good job!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.09,0:18:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I love you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.91,0:18:28.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.29,0:18:30.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always remember to keep dreaming.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.81,0:18:41.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If the wind keeps this up, we\Ncan sail as high as we want!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:43.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.09,0:18:46.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we almost to Skypiea?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.29,0:18:49.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it exists, it's past those clouds!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.27,0:18:51.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Past those clouds!
